 between a boy and his dog proves strong, as Henry vows to stick up for Ribsy…even if he is a trouble-maker!\n\nFrom the first moment Henry found Ribsy, the curious mutt was poking his nose into things he shouldn't be. Whether terrorizing the garbage man, chasing cats, or gobbling Ramona Quimby's ice-cream cone, Henry's four-legged pal has walked himself into one problem too many. So when Henry asks his dad if he can go along on the big fishing trip, Mr. Huggins agrees, but on one condition: Ribsy must stay out of mischief for two whole months. Henry is confident in his loyal dog…until Ribsy goes overboard with his appetite for chaos…literally!","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/cUHVS0g-8ZHTWZeBerxhKH59Qu7ELeb4KIFpQfRW5AI.mp3","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/OyoAcEh-NxZh0s4dQaDmH4NtDhTH4_MvGWZpB0oP_Is"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":9058,"fileSize":146895276,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2021-03-17T16:25:09.460Z"}},"cardId":"3pwvb","createdAt":"2020-10-22T12:33:53.291Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-10T11:35:54.430Z","clubAvailability":[],"sortkey":"henry-huggins-henry-and-ribsy"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}